strengths_and_weaknesses.value:
Strengthens:
(1)It is the first diffusion-based video face swapping framework;
(2)It constructs a large-scale AIDT dataset to significantly improve face feature identity-expression disentanglement;

Weaknesses:
(1)Diffusion-based method limits the practical applicability;
(2)It is better to separate the training and inference stages of Fig 2;
(3)For face encoder (Line 200-207), the 'source' and 'target' are different from the corresponding part of Fig 2.

